rns as you see the rain drip down and the trams run by outside your window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/7210a090eb195be968c2263c43c3208f.webp?t=1754496214\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/254cb16c43604a482c3f72e27131bf30.poster.avif?t=1754496214\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/254cb16c43604a482c3f72e27131bf30.webm?t=1754496214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/254cb16c43604a482c3f72e27131bf30.mp4?t=1754496214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean back and relax with a distraction free environment and a beautiful diorama in the background. Use the Pomodoro timer, to-do list, or other productivity tools to focus and get work done.</p>",
